# 🔥 Stack — C++ vs Java vs Python

All three follow the same principle:

> **LIFO — Last In, First Out**

```text
        TOP
         ↓
       [30]  ← remove first
       [20]
       [10]
      BOTTOM
```

---

## 1. Creating a Stack

| Language         | Syntax                                |
| ---------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| **C++**          | `stack<int> stk;`                     |
| **Java**         | `Stack<Integer> stk = new Stack<>();` |
| **Python List**  | `stack = []`                          |
| **Python Deque** | `stack = deque()`                     |

---

# 2. Push / Add

### C++

```cpp
stk.push(10);
```

### Java

```java
stk.push(10);
```

### Python List

```python
stack.append(10)
```

### Python Deque

```python
stack.append(10)
```

| Operation | C++      | Java     | Python     |
| --------- | -------- | -------- | ---------- |
| Push      | `push()` | `push()` | `append()` |

🔥 **Easy:** C++ and Java → `push()` | Python → `append()`

