# 🧠 Example

Suppose we perform:

```text
Push 10
Push 20
Push 30
Pop
```

### C++

```cpp
stack<int> stk;

stk.push(10);
stk.push(20);
stk.push(30);

stk.pop();
```

Final:

```text
20
10
```

### Java

```java
Stack<Integer> stk = new Stack<>();

stk.push(10);
stk.push(20);
stk.push(30);

stk.pop();
```

Final:

```text
20
10
```

### Python

```python
stack = []

stack.append(10)
stack.append(20)
stack.append(30)

stack.pop()
```

Final:

```text
[10, 20]
```

Same behavior. Different syntax. 🔥

