# ⭐ Stack vs Deque

Since you just learned Deque, this is important.

|                  | Stack           | Deque               |
| ---------------- | --------------- | ------------------- |
| Principle        | LIFO            | Both ends           |
| Add front        | ❌               | ✅                   |
| Add back         | Stack top       | ✅                   |
| Remove front     | ❌               | ✅                   |
| Remove back      | Stack top       | ✅                   |
| Access top/front | ✅               | ✅                   |
| Main purpose     | LIFO operations | Both-end operations |

Think:

```text
STACK

       TOP
        ↓
      [30] ← push/pop
      [20]
      [10]
```

versus:

```text
DEQUE

FRONT                 BACK
  ↓                     ↓
[10] [20] [30] [40]
 ↑                     ↑
add/remove          add/remove
```

### 🔥 One-line memory trick

```text
STACK
C++    → push(), pop(), top()
Java   → push(), pop(), peek()
Python → append(), pop(), [-1]
```

```text
DEQUE
C++    → push_front(), push_back()
         pop_front(), pop_back()

Java   → addFirst(), addLast()
         removeFirst(), removeLast()

Python → appendleft(), append()
         popleft(), pop()
```

**Stack = one end.**

**Deque = both ends.** 💯
